  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cast thy bread upon the waters: for thou shalt find it after many days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give a portion to seven, and also to eight; for thou knowest not what evil shall be upon the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the clouds be full of rain, they empty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "themselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the earth: and if the tree fall toward the south, or toward the north, in the place where the tree falleth, there it shall be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that observeth the wind shall not sow; and he that regardeth the clouds shall not reap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As thou knowest not what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the way of the spirit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "nor",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "how the bones",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "do grow",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the womb of her that is with child: even so thou knowest not the works of God who maketh all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the morning sow thy seed, and in the evening withhold not thine hand: for thou knowest not whether shall prosper, either this or that, or whether they both",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alike good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Truly the light",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sweet, and a pleasant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thing it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the eyes to behold the sun:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if a man live many years,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rejoice in them all; yet let him remember the days of darkness; for they shall be many. All that cometh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Rejoice, O young man, in thy youth; and let thy heart cheer thee in the days of thy youth, and walk in the ways of thine heart, and in the sight of thine eyes: but know thou, that for all these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God will bring thee into judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore remove sorrow from thy heart, and put away evil from thy flesh: for childhood and youth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
